.TH OPENCLASSCRAFTSERVER 6 "2026-08-17" "OpenClassCraft 0.1.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
openclasscraftserver \- dedicated OpenClassCraft classroom server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openclasscraftserver
[\fISERVER OPTIONS\fR]
[\fICOMMON OPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B openclasscraftserver
runs a headless OpenClassCraft server.  Use it only on a trusted classroom
network, review player privileges, set a password where appropriate, and keep
world and classroom data backed up.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Print supported options and exit.
.TP
.B --version
Print version and build information and exit.
.TP
.BI --config " file"
Load configuration from the given file.
.TP
.BI --gameid " id"
Select a game.  The bundled educational game ID is
.BR luanti_edu .
.TP
.BI --world " path"
Select a world by path.
.TP
.BI --worldname " name"
Select a world by name.
.TP
.BI --port " port"
Select the UDP network port.
.TP
.B --terminal
Display an interactive terminal when supported.
.TP
.B --run-unittests
Run the inherited engine unit tests and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LUANTI_GAME_PATH
Colon-delimited list of additional game directories.
.TP
.B LUANTI_MOD_PATH
Colon-delimited list of additional mod directories.
.TP
.B LUANTI_USER_PATH
User-data directory for an installed build.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I minetest.conf
Configuration file name retained for Luanti compatibility.
.SH BUGS
Report OpenClassCraft issues at
https://github.com/OpenClassCraft/OpenClassCraft/issues.
.SH COPYRIGHT
OpenClassCraft includes software derived from Luanti and Minetest Game.
See the installed README and license files for authorship, attribution, and
the licenses applying to each component.
.SH WWW
https://github.com/OpenClassCraft/OpenClassCraft
